# CodeChatter — frontend environment template
# Copy to .env.local and adjust. Never commit .env.local.
#
# Only VITE_-prefixed variables reach the browser bundle, and everything
# in this file is public once the app is built. Keep secrets server-side.

# Base URL of the backend API.
# Leave empty to use http://127.0.0.1:8000 in dev and the page origin in
# a production build (which is what the Docker single-origin deploy wants).
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
